rm has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T09:24:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223934","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904080-1844115010492859","game_id":"steam-4904080","kind":"update","title":"Patch 2.1.7 — QoL Improvements","summary":"Patch 2.1.7 is live. Feastfall speaks Italian The thirteenth language, all the way through — interface, charms, recipes, achievements, guest demands and the tutorial. Pick Italiano in Settings, or the game picks it for you if your machine already runs in Italian. Marked BETA in the language picker until a native speaker reads it through, same as every language starts. You can see the overfeed bonus land Beating the calorie target has always paid coins. Now you can watch it happen: five rings fil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T17:42:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492859","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904080-1843481262695257","game_id":"steam-4904080","kind":"announcement","title":"Feastfall Demo is LIVE — The Kitchen is ready for the chefs","summary":"Hey everyone, the kitchen is open now. You can try our demo and let us know. Feastfall is a cooking roguelike deckbuilder. You plate ingredient cards, the game scores them as recipes, and you get three courses to hit the calorie target before the monster at the counter runs out of patience. Between services you shop for charms that bend the maths. It won't be a five-minute slice. You get the whole run. What's in it16 services. A boss every fourth one. Clear service 16 and you've won it — then ke","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T13:18:57Z","ti